<title>UK: Halifax says no daily tender today.</title>
<headline>Halifax says no daily tender today.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Halifax Plc said on Tuesday there would be no daily tender of its shares by members today.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that no more tenders would take place until further notice.</p>
<p>Earlier the newly-floated company announced the results of its second tender which saw an average price of 732.8 pence a share.</p>
<p>The first tender saw an average price of 732.5 pence.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
</text>
